# Production security scan policy.
#
# `just check-security` scans `src/cadrumo` with Semgrep's stock security
# rules. Keep that lane focused on production source. Mirrored legal data,
# tests, and explicit test-support files are audited through separate
# provenance, redaction, fixture, and test-hygiene gates instead of the stock
# security lane. Production findings must be fixed in source or justified at
# the exact audited line; do not add production-source exclusions here to
# force a green scan.

# Mirrored AEAT/BOE/legal corpus and generated registry data.
src/cadrumo/_data/

# Tests and test-support packages.
src/cadrumo/test_*.py
src/cadrumo/**/test_*.py
